09:37.880 --> 09:38.560
Yo...

09:40.720 --> 09:41.680
Sí.

09:46.200 --> 09:47.120
Gracias.

10:39.680 --> 10:40.880
General Feng Yun,

10:42.560 --> 10:43.920
¿Por qué no lo sueltas?

10:51.520 --> 10:52.800
